Hi DJ,

If you plan to fit your models in R you might want to take a look at package such as unmarked or dsm.

If you are familiar with Bayesian models and feel comfortable using JAGS code Rahel Sollmann recently published a few papers that could be helpful.
http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1890/14-1625.1/full
http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/2041-210X.12518/full

Regards, Chris

